DW2003 Dual Screen
==================

This repository contains an Android dual-screen companion for Digimon World 2003
(PAL SLES-03936) and Flawe's Mod 2.0. All application, emulator-frontend and
PlayStation-core sources used to build official APKs live in this Git tree.

