What this repository does not contain
-------------------------------------
This project does not ship a PlayStation BIOS, a Digimon World 2003 ISO/BIN,
or Flawe's patch files. Those must be supplied by the user from a copy they
own. The only Base64 material used by CI is the private Android release
keystore stored as an encrypted GitHub Actions secret. It is not source code.

